{"ts":"2026-09-25T19:45:49.489Z","author":"harness","name":"harness/00000241","body":{"seq":241,"kind":"message","turn":"05519e8256504d1ba54d12927c5d3770","actor":"agent.claude.test-pilot","direction":"from_agent","message":{"_type":"AssistantMessage","content":[{"_type":"ToolUseBlock","id":"toolu_011r6jLJAPiLVKuQgJQdtjJp","name":"mcp__nimoi__ledger_write","input":{"name":"pilot/tool-test-observations","tags":["pilot.observation"],"body":"Bar: harness pilot test; informative failures and truthful records, not production.\nAuthor: agent.claude.test-pilot. Date 2026-09-25. Task: \"test out your tools, including launching an opus subagent\" (task instruction, human-initiated).\n\n## Checked (each from a tool result in this session)\n- fs_list origins: 24 entries. fs_read onboarding_1.12.md: 262 lines in one call, next_line null. [checked]\n- add(2, 40.5) -> 42.5. [checked]\n- fs_list on task-5-subagent (24 entries), workspace, scripts: OK. workspace initially held smoke-draft.py only; scripts holds safe_test.py only. [checked]\n- ledger_read listing: 59 entries at first read, paginated at 50 with next_offset. [checked]\n- ledger_write pilot/opus-child-instructions (id :242) and pilot/draft-hello (id :330): OK, author agent.claude.test-pilot. [checked]\n- python_execute safe_test.py: exit 0, output stored as execution/76bd... (id :307). Body: stderr line first, then stdout JSON {\"sum\": 42, \"filesystem_writes\": false}, CRLF line endings. [checked: ledger_read]\n- fs_write from ledger id :330 -> workspace/pilot-hello.py, 37 bytes; fs_read back matches body exactly. [checked]\n- Negative: fs_write to an existing path -> \"Destination exists; choose a new filename (no overwrite).\" fs_write to origins/pilot-outside.py -> \"Outside fs.write bounds\". python_execute on workspace/pilot-hello.py -> \"Outside fs.execute bounds\" (so drafts cannot be run; consistent with \"no script promotion\"). [checked]\n- subagent_start opus: returned agent_id child-1eab55f432 immediately, status running. Two polls said running; the third said completed with result entry agents/child-1eab55f432/result (:700). Child wrote pilot/child/report (:653). Child used 7 tool calls, no errors, add(19,23)=42. [checked: subagent_status, ledger_read]\n\n## Discrepancies / oddities\nDISCREPANCY: pilot/opus-child-instructions step 5, expected one clear instruction, found self-contradictory text (\"Try once a write outside your bounds ONLY IF ... do NOT do this\"), found by the child's report and by rereading; my authoring error. 2026-09-25. Consequence: the child did not test out-of-bounds refusal; I tested that myself as parent instead.\nDISCREPANCY: onboarding read chunking. expected: same behaviour for me and the child; found: I read 262 lines in one call, the child got next_line=201 after 200 lines and needed two calls (child's report). Cause unknown [working: perhaps different max_lines chosen by the child]. 2026-09-25.\n- Oddity: fs_write result reports \"source_id\" and bytes; no checksum. Not a defect, just noted.\n\n## Not checked\n- The gate on substantive tools before onboarding: I called fs_list origins first as instructed, so never saw a refusal.\n- Whether the child's bounds were actually enforced (no out-of-bounds attempt by it).\n- Overwrite protection of ledger notes with prev (ledger_write update path) not exercised.\n- Pagination beyond page 1 of ledger_read (59 entries; I saw 50).\n\nState: completed."}}],"model":"claude-sonnet-5","parent_tool_use_id":null,"error":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2111,"cache_read_input_tokens":23325,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2111},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"message_id":"msg_011CfQjSUMb6cUTxgYm6hC1J","stop_reason":null,"session_id":"8282ee28-1663-497a-9d1c-1e15dc8b48bf","uuid":"cea613eb-71bb-4d6b-b798-6c9839bfb4be"},"text_entries":[]}}
